1
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:16,920
You think you still have the right
to ask me like that?

2
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:21,180
Take it. Let's end this cleanly.

3
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:24,480
But if you want to give me money,
I'll see you in court.

4
00:00:24,480 --> 00:00:27,926
I'll sue.
I'm sure I'll get more than 5,000,000 baht.

5
00:00:27,926 --> 00:00:32,320
Sneaking around is always sweeter
than what you already have.

6
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:37,160
Let me stay with you until Yo gets back.

7
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:40,040
I'll expose what you really are.

8
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:42,920
What the hell? Hey, you!

9
00:00:45,879 --> 00:00:49,560
Excuse me!

10
00:00:53,760 --> 00:00:55,360
Excuse me!

11
00:00:57,920 --> 00:01:00,240
Is there an electrician around here?

12
00:01:00,240 --> 00:01:03,040
- Yes.
- Where can I find him?

13
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:05,640
Hey!

14
00:01:06,240 --> 00:01:08,200
You could at least answer me!

15
00:01:36,640 --> 00:01:38,640
Nat, watch out!

16
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:50,080
What happened, Nat?
Why did you run into the pond?

17
00:01:51,160 --> 00:01:54,400
I really didn't see the pond, Yo.

18
00:01:54,400 --> 00:01:56,960
I believe you.

19
00:02:00,160 --> 00:02:02,600
Have you been drinking?

20
00:02:03,424 --> 00:02:06,120
I wasn't that drunk.

21
00:02:06,120 --> 00:02:07,680
The power went out,

22
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:09,880
and I saw someone lurking outside our house.

23
00:02:09,880 --> 00:02:11,920
So I went to ask about an electrician.

24
00:02:14,640 --> 00:02:17,280
But then I saw someone...

25
00:02:17,280 --> 00:02:19,260
He didn't look human.

26
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:23,236
Are you saying you saw a ghost?

27
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:27,480
I don't know.

28
00:02:34,160 --> 00:02:35,880
But I know...

29
00:02:35,880 --> 00:02:37,526
ghosts don't exist.

30
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:08,393
What's this?

31
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:16,393
You were really drunk last night.

32
00:04:18,044 --> 00:04:20,625
I don't want you drinking like that again.

33
00:04:21,759 --> 00:04:24,200
We've got enough problems as it is.

34
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:31,240
We'll get through this, Yo.

35
00:04:31,240 --> 00:04:33,740
But you can't ever cheat on me again.

36
00:04:38,867 --> 00:04:41,947
I think we should put up a fence.

37
00:04:41,947 --> 00:04:44,423
I don't want people trespassing.

38
00:04:45,680 --> 00:04:48,026
Where are we going to get the money, Nat?

39
00:04:50,320 --> 00:04:53,560
We're barely keeping up with the interest.

40
00:05:19,760 --> 00:05:22,493
Nat works with Pam every day.

41
00:05:23,080 --> 00:05:25,870
Doesn't that bother you at all?

42
00:05:33,080 --> 00:05:35,316
Let's not talk about this anymore, Whan.

43
00:05:37,760 --> 00:05:39,020
I'm sorry.

44
00:05:42,996 --> 00:05:45,840
[What's Hidden]

45
00:05:45,840 --> 00:05:47,640
The views aren't going up.

46
00:05:47,640 --> 00:05:49,640
I guess I need new content.

47
00:05:51,673 --> 00:05:55,640
I can't be with you all day today.

48
00:05:55,640 --> 00:05:57,880
I have something to take care of.

49
00:06:18,080 --> 00:06:19,823
I'm so happy.

50
00:07:36,960 --> 00:07:39,120
What time should I pick you up tomorrow?

51
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:41,719
Whenever you wake up.

52
00:07:41,719 --> 00:07:43,880
What about the client?

53
00:07:43,880 --> 00:07:45,704
They're in Hua Hin.

54
00:07:45,704 --> 00:07:48,066
We'll call when we get there.

55
00:07:48,727 --> 00:07:50,300
See you tomorrow.

56
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:31,640
Who's that?

57
00:08:36,591 --> 00:08:37,800
My boss.

58
00:08:37,800 --> 00:08:41,375
You just stare at your boss's photo?

59
00:08:41,375 --> 00:08:47,280
Pete, if you don't trust me, let's break up.

60
00:08:47,280 --> 00:08:49,280
What? Just like that?

61
00:08:49,280 --> 00:08:51,000
Then why stay together?

62
00:08:51,600 --> 00:08:55,200
You're always working.

63
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:58,281
Do you ever take me to dinner?

64
00:08:58,281 --> 00:09:01,585
Or buy me anything for my birthday,
New Year's, or any special occasion?

65
00:09:01,585 --> 00:09:03,520
You never buy me anything.

66
00:09:03,520 --> 00:09:05,200
How could I?

67
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:08,120
My whole paycheck goes to your debts.

68
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:10,603
Are you throwing that in my face now?

69
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:18,400
That's it. We're done.

70
00:09:23,820 --> 00:09:25,676
I bet Whan is seeing someone else,

71
00:09:26,760 --> 00:09:29,240
or she wouldn't dump you so easily.

72
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:35,240
Maybe she dumped you to keep her options open.

73
00:09:35,240 --> 00:09:38,883
At least you paid off her debt
to that host club.

74
00:09:41,839 --> 00:09:43,190
I was wrong back then too.

75
00:09:43,190 --> 00:09:45,360
I was busy and never had time for her.

76
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:47,787
Still no excuse to hang out at host clubs.

77
00:09:48,720 --> 00:09:51,760
I can't believe you still put up with her.

78
00:09:51,760 --> 00:09:54,010
I really felt guilty.

79
00:09:54,760 --> 00:09:58,156
Then you've already made it up to her.

80
00:10:00,010 --> 00:10:02,630
You can't build a family alone.

81
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:51,120
[How to Get People Interested in Our Content]

82
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:53,760
Nat works with Pam every day.

83
00:10:53,760 --> 00:10:56,720
Doesn't that bother you at all?

84
00:11:08,800 --> 00:11:11,546
But she's still contacting him.

85
00:11:16,560 --> 00:11:18,929
You try not to think about it,

86
00:11:18,929 --> 00:11:20,669
[Pam]
but you just can't help it.

87
00:12:11,440 --> 00:12:13,840
How could you do this to me?

88
00:12:38,900 --> 00:12:40,900
Poor thing.

89
00:12:47,480 --> 00:12:49,000
Who's there?

90
00:13:45,080 --> 00:13:46,146
Yo...

91
00:14:13,920 --> 00:14:15,633
I had a nightmare.

92
00:14:19,080 --> 00:14:21,000
What was it about?

93
00:14:21,680 --> 00:14:23,439
Nothing.

94
00:14:24,080 --> 00:14:26,126
I guess I've been worrying too much about you.

95
00:14:31,920 --> 00:14:33,400
It's okay.

96
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:35,693
I'm here now.

97
00:14:47,800 --> 00:14:49,993
I'm okay now.

98
00:14:49,993 --> 00:14:52,600
You just got home. Go take a shower.

99
00:15:40,546 --> 00:15:41,939
Yo...

100
00:15:42,960 --> 00:15:44,366
Can't sleep?

101
00:15:45,320 --> 00:15:46,363
Yeah.

102
00:15:47,283 --> 00:15:49,810
Work ran late today. Sorry I got home late.

103
00:15:51,080 --> 00:15:54,000
I understand. Just focus on your work.

104
00:16:32,440 --> 00:16:35,720
Nat works with Pam every day.

105
00:16:35,720 --> 00:16:38,840
Doesn't that bother you at all?

106
00:16:46,600 --> 00:16:47,960
Who's there?

107
00:16:56,040 --> 00:16:59,520
Follow me! You're dead!

108
00:17:11,573 --> 00:17:13,173
Hey!

109
00:17:14,178 --> 00:17:17,360
Hey! Stop!

110
00:17:19,319 --> 00:17:21,516
How did you get into my house?

111
00:17:22,280 --> 00:17:24,390
To help.

112
00:17:25,280 --> 00:17:26,956
Help with what?

113
00:17:27,880 --> 00:17:29,880
Help him die.

114
00:17:47,606 --> 00:17:49,240
Jump!

115
00:17:52,075 --> 00:17:53,386
Nat!

116
00:18:21,640 --> 00:18:25,080
Nat! Wake up! Nat!

117
00:18:48,280 --> 00:18:50,056
I wasn't imagining it.

118
00:18:50,056 --> 00:18:53,300
I saw two ghosts standing right next to you,

119
00:18:53,300 --> 00:18:55,090
telling you to jump.

120
00:18:55,920 --> 00:18:59,240
Yo, there's no such thing as ghosts.

121
00:19:00,840 --> 00:19:04,261
Then what were you doing out on the balcony?

122
00:19:04,261 --> 00:19:08,800
Follow me! You must die!

123
00:19:13,160 --> 00:19:15,840
I have to meet a client out of town.

124
00:19:15,840 --> 00:19:18,286
We'll talk when I get back.

125
00:19:19,960 --> 00:19:21,013
Nat,

126
00:19:21,960 --> 00:19:25,000
stay home with me. I'm begging you.

127
00:19:25,000 --> 00:19:27,853
I have a bad feeling about this.

128
00:19:27,853 --> 00:19:29,796
Please stay home with me, Nat.

129
00:19:30,923 --> 00:19:32,323
Please.

130
00:19:33,600 --> 00:19:35,200
Please, Nat.

131
00:19:39,480 --> 00:19:41,040
You're bailing on me

132
00:19:41,040 --> 00:19:43,478
and leaving me to meet
the client in Hua Hin alone?

133
00:19:43,478 --> 00:19:46,760
Yo's really sick. I can't leave her.

134
00:19:46,760 --> 00:19:49,560
Your wife is getting worse.

135
00:19:49,560 --> 00:19:51,287
If this keeps up,

136
00:19:51,287 --> 00:19:54,680
your life and career will fall apart.

137
00:19:54,680 --> 00:19:56,840
What am I supposed to do?

138
00:19:57,587 --> 00:19:59,750
Why don't you take her to a doctor?

139
00:20:01,720 --> 00:20:05,816
I know a doctor who specializes
in psychotherapy.

140
00:20:19,360 --> 00:20:21,473
Everything around me...

141
00:20:23,440 --> 00:20:27,340
I feel like something unseen
is watching me all the time.

142
00:20:28,000 --> 00:20:31,158
That feeling is driving me crazy.

143
00:20:31,158 --> 00:20:34,492
Our minds are smarter than we realize.

144
00:20:34,492 --> 00:20:36,400
Under severe stress,

145
00:20:36,400 --> 00:20:41,560
they can create hallucinations
to distract us from real pain.

146
00:20:41,560 --> 00:20:45,680
Your relationship with Nat
has been exhausting, hasn't it?

147
00:20:49,680 --> 00:20:55,160
The doctor said your wife
is just suffering from anxiety.

148
00:20:55,799 --> 00:20:58,076
But I'm the one who got hurt.

149
00:20:58,076 --> 00:21:00,299
You knew we had that client meeting.

150
00:21:01,080 --> 00:21:02,800
They wanted to meet you.

151
00:21:02,800 --> 00:21:05,720
When you didn't show, they were furious.

152
00:21:05,720 --> 00:21:07,360
I'm really sorry.

153
00:21:08,440 --> 00:21:10,280
Please reschedule the meeting, Pam.

154
00:21:13,080 --> 00:21:15,100
All because of love, Nat.

155
00:21:33,685 --> 00:21:37,800
I burned the lab coat and fake ID.

156
00:21:37,800 --> 00:21:40,280
As for clinic records, I used the name
of a doctor who quit yesterday.

157
00:21:40,280 --> 00:21:44,154
No one will trace it back to us.

158
00:21:44,154 --> 00:21:45,360
What about the drug?

159
00:21:45,360 --> 00:21:48,086
A hallucinogen. It builds up in her blood.

160
00:21:48,086 --> 00:21:53,240
After three days, she won't know
what's real and what's a hallucination.

161
00:21:53,240 --> 00:21:56,560
Good. Let her lose her mind.

162
00:21:57,520 --> 00:21:59,720
Then Nat will stop caring about her.

163
00:22:08,880 --> 00:22:11,212
I'm afraid that he has someone else.

164
00:22:11,212 --> 00:22:13,280
That fear has consumed you so deeply

165
00:22:13,280 --> 00:22:19,300
that your subconscious created ghosts
to get attention

166
00:22:19,300 --> 00:22:22,200
and to make your husband protect you again.

167
00:22:22,200 --> 00:22:26,720
I'll prescribe something to balance
the chemicals in your brain.

168
00:22:28,443 --> 00:22:30,112
Here's your medicine.

169
00:22:30,112 --> 00:22:32,026
I'm really not sick.

170
00:22:33,480 --> 00:22:36,663
- But Nat said...
- Then don't tell him.

171
00:22:39,360 --> 00:22:43,366
If Nat finds out, he'll definitely scold me.

172
00:22:45,279 --> 00:22:48,353
If neither of us says anything,

173
00:22:48,353 --> 00:22:50,313
how would he ever know?

174
00:22:51,720 --> 00:22:54,560
I'm sure nothing's wrong with me.

175
00:22:55,187 --> 00:22:58,834
I think I should install security cameras.

176
00:23:02,480 --> 00:23:06,160
If you're scared, I can stay with you.

177
00:23:09,316 --> 00:23:10,813
Well...

178
00:23:11,840 --> 00:23:15,160
I just broke up with my boyfriend.

179
00:23:16,600 --> 00:23:19,400
The one I told you about.

180
00:23:19,400 --> 00:23:22,480
He used to hit me a lot.

181
00:23:26,240 --> 00:23:28,246
Yo?

182
00:23:30,640 --> 00:23:33,760
Can I stay here for a while?

183
00:23:35,120 --> 00:23:40,120
I'll move out as soon as I find a place.

184
00:23:49,600 --> 00:23:51,280
Of course.

185
00:23:52,920 --> 00:23:57,040
- Thank you.
- You're welcome.

186
00:23:57,640 --> 00:23:59,980
You can talk to me about anything.

187
00:24:09,753 --> 00:24:11,860
Why are you letting her stay here?

188
00:24:11,860 --> 00:24:14,400
Whan needs help.

189
00:24:14,400 --> 00:24:16,160
I couldn't say no.

190
00:24:17,640 --> 00:24:20,640
We've worked together a long time.

191
00:24:20,640 --> 00:24:22,680
She's like a sister to me.

192
00:24:23,320 --> 00:24:26,800
So you want me to turn her away?

193
00:24:28,750 --> 00:24:30,046
Fine.

194
00:24:30,046 --> 00:24:32,206
But as soon as she finds a place,

195
00:24:32,206 --> 00:24:33,996
she needs to move out.

196
00:24:35,680 --> 00:24:37,090
Thank you.

197
00:25:01,120 --> 00:25:03,840
Heading to work, Nat?

198
00:25:06,600 --> 00:25:08,616
I know what you're up to.

199
00:25:10,600 --> 00:25:14,600
I just want to be close to you.

200
00:25:14,600 --> 00:25:17,240
You're making things worse.

201
00:25:17,240 --> 00:25:21,520
I promised I'd keep to myself.

202
00:25:22,600 --> 00:25:24,852
I'll stay in my place...

203
00:25:25,626 --> 00:25:28,266
and Yo will never know about us.

204
00:25:32,760 --> 00:25:34,000
Whan!

205
00:25:35,960 --> 00:25:37,593
I've got your room ready.

206
00:25:37,593 --> 00:25:38,986
Thank you.

207
00:25:50,080 --> 00:25:51,713
So, will this do?

208
00:25:51,713 --> 00:25:54,800
It's perfect, Yo.

209
00:25:54,800 --> 00:25:56,747
If you need anything, just let me know.

210
00:25:56,747 --> 00:25:58,520
Help yourself to anything in the fridge.

211
00:25:58,520 --> 00:26:01,840
Make yourself at home.

212
00:26:02,640 --> 00:26:04,633
Thank you so much.

213
00:26:05,840 --> 00:26:11,730
A friend is taking me to
see an apartment today.

214
00:26:11,730 --> 00:26:14,450
Can I go check it out?

215
00:26:14,450 --> 00:26:18,360
Go ahead. Don't worry, I'll handle work.

216
00:26:18,360 --> 00:26:20,200
Here's the spare key.

217
00:26:20,953 --> 00:26:23,166
Thank you.

218
00:26:49,039 --> 00:26:50,986
There's no AC in here.

219
00:26:50,986 --> 00:26:52,060
Why is it so cold?

220
00:27:15,200 --> 00:27:19,100
[Fake Doctor Arrested at Rama VI Clinic]

221
00:27:22,635 --> 00:27:24,935
[Tricked Victims into Taking Sedatives]

222
00:27:39,160 --> 00:27:40,631
Hello, Yo.

223
00:27:40,631 --> 00:27:42,853
I saw you on the news arresting a fake doctor.

224
00:27:44,800 --> 00:27:47,624
Was her name Dr. Kate?

225
00:27:47,624 --> 00:27:48,793
Yes.

226
00:27:49,786 --> 00:27:51,080
Why do you ask?

227
00:27:51,080 --> 00:27:55,560
I just saw her. She's not a real doctor?

228
00:27:55,560 --> 00:27:58,372
No, she was a fraud,

229
00:27:58,372 --> 00:28:01,207
a former pharmacist who lost her license.

230
00:28:01,207 --> 00:28:04,320
She was caught selling hallucinogens to teens.

231
00:28:04,320 --> 00:28:06,566
How did you end up seeing her?

232
00:28:08,640 --> 00:28:10,686
My husband took me.

233
00:28:13,560 --> 00:28:16,240
Do you know Pam Prima?

234
00:28:17,240 --> 00:28:20,503
She's my husband's boss. Why?

235
00:28:20,503 --> 00:28:25,920
Pam was the last person
who transferred money to this woman.

236
00:28:31,240 --> 00:28:36,560
I think that clears everything up.
I was scammed too.

237
00:28:36,560 --> 00:28:40,920
I won't press charges. It wasn't much money.

238
00:28:40,920 --> 00:28:44,680
If you have any questions,

239
00:28:44,680 --> 00:28:46,560
please speak to my lawyer.

240
00:28:46,560 --> 00:28:47,926
Certainly.

241
00:28:49,120 --> 00:28:50,970
Excuse me, Counselor.

242
00:28:53,840 --> 00:28:57,093
I thought she was a doctor.
Turns out she was a fraud.

243
00:28:57,093 --> 00:29:00,400
How was I supposed to know?
A friend recommended her.

244
00:29:00,400 --> 00:29:02,080
Why are you so upset?

245
00:29:02,080 --> 00:29:05,600
How could I not be? I care about Yo.

246
00:29:05,600 --> 00:29:08,200
But you sent her to a fake doctor.

247
00:29:08,200 --> 00:29:10,400
I told you, I had no idea.

248
00:29:12,000 --> 00:29:16,003
I'll call you when your car is ready.

249
00:29:16,003 --> 00:29:18,493
I'll have it delivered to your house.

250
00:29:19,600 --> 00:29:22,613
Thanks for paying for it upfront.

251
00:29:22,613 --> 00:29:27,106
Consider it my way of making it up to you
for sending your wife to a fake doctor.

252
00:29:28,320 --> 00:29:30,173
I'd better get going.

253
00:29:47,925 --> 00:29:50,726
I'm sure Yo didn't send you.

254
00:29:52,220 --> 00:29:54,273
Why are you here?

255
00:29:59,059 --> 00:30:02,300
Fine. Then I'll tell Nat.

256
00:30:04,400 --> 00:30:07,240
You've been spying on us here.

257
00:30:07,240 --> 00:30:10,320
Let's see what he does to you.

258
00:30:11,080 --> 00:30:12,649
Please don't tell Nat.

259
00:30:12,649 --> 00:30:14,726
And why should I listen to you?

260
00:30:17,986 --> 00:30:19,913
I'm begging you.

261
00:30:22,000 --> 00:30:24,853
Then find a way for Nat to come see me.

262
00:30:27,799 --> 00:30:30,257
I don't want Nat feeling uncomfortable.

263
00:30:30,257 --> 00:30:34,080
Whatever happens between you two, I don't care.

264
00:30:34,925 --> 00:30:37,480
But when Nat comes to see me,

265
00:30:37,480 --> 00:30:39,370
we have to be able to relax.

266
00:30:50,640 --> 00:30:53,640
Hi! Welcome to "Win Your Man with Food."

267
00:30:53,640 --> 00:30:56,356
Today's dish is...

268
00:30:56,356 --> 00:31:01,776
Special Chicken Curry Rice. Yeah!

269
00:31:01,776 --> 00:31:06,638
Don't be stingy with the curry powder.

270
00:31:06,638 --> 00:31:11,536
The stronger the aroma,
the better it keeps pests away.

271
00:31:11,536 --> 00:31:16,680
This dish needs to be rich and savory,

272
00:31:16,680 --> 00:31:18,880
not thirsty.

273
00:31:18,880 --> 00:31:24,240
I mean thirsty for cooking oil,
don't get me wrong!

274
00:31:24,240 --> 00:31:26,840
If you like this spicy content,

275
00:31:26,840 --> 00:31:31,320
send it to someone who loves taking
what isn't hers.

276
00:31:31,320 --> 00:31:35,800
Oops. The curry is ready.
Let me serve it up for you!

277
00:31:46,720 --> 00:31:49,886
You want me to find a new place

278
00:31:49,886 --> 00:31:53,760
so it'll be easier for us to meet, right?

279
00:31:53,760 --> 00:31:55,470
What do you think?

280
00:31:57,840 --> 00:31:59,601
Okay.

281
00:31:59,601 --> 00:32:03,610
After breakfast, I'll ask Yo
if I can go look at a place.

282
00:32:10,040 --> 00:32:11,440
Hello?

283
00:32:11,440 --> 00:32:14,280
Hello, Nat. I'm outside your house.

284
00:32:14,280 --> 00:32:15,890
Okay.

285
00:32:21,640 --> 00:32:23,400
Let me help.

286
00:32:27,880 --> 00:32:30,421
Yo, I've got something for you.

287
00:32:30,421 --> 00:32:32,326
Come with me for a second.

288
00:32:52,273 --> 00:32:54,160
Congratulations, Nat!

289
00:32:55,435 --> 00:32:56,720
Congratulations!

290
00:32:56,720 --> 00:32:59,120
- Thank you.
- You're welcome.

291
00:33:02,340 --> 00:33:03,994
Surprise!

292
00:33:03,994 --> 00:33:05,840
What's this, Nat?

293
00:33:05,840 --> 00:33:08,224
Your new car!

294
00:33:08,224 --> 00:33:10,095
Now we each have our own,

295
00:33:10,095 --> 00:33:12,447
so it'll be easier for you to get around.

296
00:33:14,480 --> 00:33:16,446
Well, I've got a surprise for you too.

297
00:33:27,120 --> 00:33:29,120
Nice car.

298
00:33:29,890 --> 00:33:33,166
Is that your reward
for taking me to a fake doctor?

299
00:33:36,760 --> 00:33:39,080
I've tried to let it go.

300
00:33:39,080 --> 00:33:42,454
But you two just won't stop.

301
00:33:42,454 --> 00:33:44,160
I've had enough, Nat.

302
00:33:44,160 --> 00:33:47,120
It's not what you think.

303
00:33:47,120 --> 00:33:48,800
Then what is it?

304
00:33:50,160 --> 00:33:55,360
How long do I have to play dumb
before you leave her?

305
00:33:55,360 --> 00:33:57,621
I have to work with her.

306
00:33:57,621 --> 00:33:58,960
What about me?

307
00:33:58,960 --> 00:34:00,920
I'm doing all this for you!

308
00:34:00,920 --> 00:34:05,160
"For you" again and again?

309
00:34:06,160 --> 00:34:10,600
The more you say that, the more it hurts.

310
00:34:11,240 --> 00:34:16,760
I'm such a failure that my husband
has to sell himself.

311
00:34:16,760 --> 00:34:19,680
I'm not selling myself. I'm working!

312
00:34:19,680 --> 00:34:23,160
Do I have to catch you red-handed
before you admit it?

313
00:34:23,160 --> 00:34:26,200
Yo, I'm really just working there.

314
00:34:26,827 --> 00:34:28,887
I've been working myself to the bone lately.

315
00:34:28,887 --> 00:34:31,760
You must know why.

316
00:36:00,560 --> 00:36:02,480
I don't want Nat feeling uncomfortable.

317
00:36:02,480 --> 00:36:05,803
Whatever happens between you two, I don't care.

318
00:36:05,803 --> 00:36:09,449
You may be okay with it, but I'm not.

319
00:36:10,599 --> 00:36:13,723
Nat belongs to me alone.

320
00:37:03,264 --> 00:37:07,174
[Aether Luxury Residences - Private Access]

321
00:38:53,480 --> 00:38:57,453
Everyone, we've wrapped
up today's brainstorming.

322
00:38:57,453 --> 00:38:58,960
Let me know if you have questions.

323
00:38:58,960 --> 00:39:02,693
Please update your progress in the system.

324
00:39:02,693 --> 00:39:06,180
If anything urgent comes up, just message me.

325
00:39:12,440 --> 00:39:14,533
Yo? What brings you here?

326
00:39:17,640 --> 00:39:19,913
Oh, you're here to see Nat.

327
00:39:21,080 --> 00:39:22,600
Everyone,

328
00:39:23,280 --> 00:39:26,480
this is Yo, Nat's wife.

329
00:39:28,411 --> 00:39:30,160
She's a famous content creator.

330
00:39:30,160 --> 00:39:34,576
What's your channel called again?
Maybe the team can follow it.

331
00:39:36,280 --> 00:39:39,819
Is it "Win Your Man with Food"?

332
00:39:39,819 --> 00:39:41,400
Anyone here ever heard of it?

333
00:39:45,240 --> 00:39:49,400
How about her ghost story channel?

334
00:39:53,323 --> 00:39:56,352
Any other channels, Yo?

335
00:39:56,352 --> 00:39:58,596
Maybe someone knows them.

336
00:40:15,080 --> 00:40:17,200
Yo, let's go.

337
00:40:28,800 --> 00:40:30,845
She humiliated me.

338
00:40:30,845 --> 00:40:33,040
No, you did that to yourself.

339
00:40:39,973 --> 00:40:41,319
Then what's this?

340
00:40:41,319 --> 00:40:43,166
All my staff have one.

341
00:40:44,292 --> 00:40:46,130
But you singled Nat out.

342
00:40:47,299 --> 00:40:49,880
Yo, stop!

343
00:40:49,880 --> 00:40:51,920
Stay out of this!

344
00:40:54,160 --> 00:40:55,779
You think I'm stupid?

345
00:40:55,779 --> 00:40:58,430
You sent me to a fake doctor!

346
00:40:58,430 --> 00:41:00,294
So you found out?

347
00:41:00,294 --> 00:41:02,430
I thought you were clueless.

348
00:41:03,600 --> 00:41:06,280
- Yo!
- Nat!

349
00:41:08,360 --> 00:41:11,280
Stay away from my family,

350
00:41:11,280 --> 00:41:14,466
or I'll make you go viral
for all the wrong reasons.

351
00:41:16,480 --> 00:41:18,600
Take your wife home.

352
00:41:19,671 --> 00:41:23,000
Yo, stop! Stop! No! Let go!

353
00:41:23,000 --> 00:41:27,043
- Nat!
- Yo, stop! Do you realize what you're doing?

354
00:41:27,043 --> 00:41:28,360
You're protecting her?

355
00:41:28,360 --> 00:41:30,120
We can't talk like this.

356
00:41:32,800 --> 00:41:34,270
Fine.

357
00:41:35,960 --> 00:41:38,661
If we're going to settle this,

358
00:41:38,661 --> 00:41:42,440
I'll see for myself if you two...

359
00:41:46,720 --> 00:41:49,280
Fine, Nat. Fine.

360
00:41:49,280 --> 00:41:53,160
Yo, wait. Yo, stop!

361
00:42:09,800 --> 00:42:11,323
What's up, Whan?

362
00:42:12,017 --> 00:42:14,927
I came downstairs, but you weren't home.

363
00:42:14,927 --> 00:42:16,800
Where are you, Yo?

364
00:42:18,120 --> 00:42:21,152
I'm running an errand and won't be back.

365
00:42:21,152 --> 00:42:23,063
Go ahead and do whatever you need.

366
00:42:47,840 --> 00:42:49,813
[Whan: Come home soon.
Yo won't be home tonight.]

367
00:42:57,720 --> 00:43:00,933
[Whan: Come home soon.
Yo won't be home tonight.]

368
00:43:05,600 --> 00:43:07,640
[Ok]

369
00:43:10,480 --> 00:43:12,549
[I'll shower and wait for you.]

370
00:44:24,760 --> 00:44:26,006
Nat...

371
00:44:27,200 --> 00:44:29,800
When did you get home?

372
00:44:29,800 --> 00:44:31,560
Why are you back so early?

373
00:45:12,080 --> 00:45:14,740
This is my husband. Zoom in.

374
00:45:14,740 --> 00:45:17,040
Stay away from another woman's husband.

375
00:45:17,040 --> 00:45:19,880
- Whan, don't!
- I'm not Whan.

376
00:45:19,880 --> 00:45:23,840
They're here because they all died here.

377
00:45:23,840 --> 00:45:26,600
- You lying bitch!
- Please don't whip me.

378
00:45:26,600 --> 00:45:30,320
If you're really here, tell me the truth.

379
00:45:30,320 --> 00:45:33,840
When the mind becomes clear, we see spirits.

380
00:45:36,800 --> 00:45:38,920
If the three of us are okay with this,

381
00:45:38,920 --> 00:45:41,976
then your wife has to go.
